<description>&lt;p&gt;A pipe bomb exploded in Yala province, wounding five army officers, and a separate bomb injured five security volunteers in the same province. An air hostess is linked to a trafficking ring that smuggles Chinese nationals across the Thai-Malaysian border. Cambodian Prime Minister Hun Manet and Thai officials are exchanging accusations over a border dispute while continuing maritime border talks. A fiberoptic cable was discovered linking a border house to a Myanmar casino operation. The conflict recorded 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/video/2026/10/15/thailand-bangkok-protesters-decry-imf-and-world-bank-warn-of-destructive-capitalism&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wto.org/english/news_e/news26_e/trfin_16oct26_517_e.htm&quot;&gt;World Trade Organization&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxOaTZfNUFjYjB3MEhUUGlBTExIeS1WSzc2TllnZzhabUF5aHRxYWV4N09xVzctUWVzbjhvZGctcEVTYUJSdlB4RThQNnhkaXlZcU9ydEVFR0luUEVSZUFLUFdIWUhiamVrZFItYklBa055WlkxaXNRY2ZORGozTEpfU1RaWk5tMGFFTk9mT010VmQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yahoo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTE5XTHdVajYxQ2VZTDFWWGdwc0dEN0JFOXRIcEIwNm9RVDl2RWVKTV9NdnAzVnZEOWpnZGNnV1M1M2xrTlRPMVZidkNFdEk5MnZ2aGMzcXc0LVFmLWo3ZDdjTG1GMXFuT0VMLWRtWWg1NGI0c29fV2EwRWZDQUZRNUU?oc=5&quot;&gt;CamboJA News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxPOXpHNTlIYjFBUmRhUkJnaU1fc1hKMGdpMk1QTnB5ZU8zQlNIemxHRFNGT1NMV2tjX2c4bFVsMFVXZXowSVdQRjF4Q2Zsd1NiTF9SdWFfUzZBZnMyNnVEbTc4MmhfSWFONWZ0a0U0UmJycmk1Q21XSWpaMVdaejlNSGh6aGJWRThhV2VCOF9KV245UzJYeXN3NWFEVlJsZGs?oc=5&quot;&gt;Thaiger&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxOVkY3dVFTOGVZQWhGVlVxX09tUnFJNnpNUS00YjFJVlJ